[HEADING=2]1.0.0 Beta 1[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*][B]Added:[/B] Standalone RPG domain platform for Genres and Publishers with AdminCP management, manual/alphabetical sorting, and publisher JSON/ZIP export and import.
[*][B]Added:[/B] Automatic style property management ([ICODE]cv6Genre[/ICODE]) for genre pills, badges, and filter controls.
[*][B]Added:[/B] AdminCP RPG Suite Ecosystem & Add-on Overview ([ICODE]admin.php?rpg/manager[/ICODE]) with module status, direct enable toggles, and resource links.
[*][B]Added:[/B] Public RPG Suite Dashboard ([ICODE]index.php?rpg/[/ICODE]) with unified left-sidebar Genre filter across all genre-aware widgets.
[*][B]Added:[/B] Modular integration bridge connecting [DD] Character Database, [DD] Dice Roller, [DD] BattleMap Generator, and [DD] Handout Generator (Setting primary wiresets, Campaign Forum wiresets, rollable character fields, character dice sets, campaign content linking, and In-Thread RPG Companion bar).
[*][B]Added:[/B] CLI command [ICODE]php cmd.php dd-rpg:sync-schema[/ICODE] for non-destructive bridge schema synchronization.
[/LIST]
